  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please say 'Sales', 'Support', or 'Returns' to be connected to the right department.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770229000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Returns.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770240133333
    },
    {
      "text": "Connecting you to a Returns Specialist now.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770240866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770243933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770249933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770251933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. It's VF8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770256666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it. One moment... Okay, I see the order for the VeloFit Pro-Pedal cycling shoes, delivered nine days ago. To get started, can you tell me what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770258199998
    },
    {
      "text": "They hurt my feet. I got blisters.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770273333331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Comfort is key. Just to be sure, did you get a chance to adjust the cleats? Sometimes improper placement can cause pressure points.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770275799997
    },
    {
      "text": "I moved them. The shoes are the problem. I want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770286666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. I was just checking to make sure it wasn't a simple fix. Let me pull up our policy... and yes, you are well within the 90-day return window. I can absolutely process this return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770290666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what do I do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770303999996
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just initiated the return in our system. You'll receive an email with a pre-paid shipping label within the next five minutes. Just pack the cycling shoes in their original box, attach the label, and you can drop them off at any postal service location.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770305666662
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Another errand to run.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770322999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Once our warehouse scans the return, your refund will be credited back to your original payment method within 3-5 business days. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770325133328
    },
    {
      "text": "No. Just make sure the money shows up.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 92822,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770337333328
    },
    {
      "text": "It certainly will. Thank you for calling VeloFit, and have a good day.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764770340066661
    }
  ]
